PLANS STRUCTURAL REVIEW PERFORMED BY:  
Jeff Faucett - (352) 438-2416
5/14/2026 -  DENIED as noted


SCOPE:   SFR ““ MODEL / CMU CONST. / 1 STORY
                3 BEDROOMS - 2 BATHS / COVERED LANAI
                2 CAR GARAGE - LEFT - FRONT LOADED


REVIEW COMMENTS:
1)  For clarification purposes, a ''Response to Comments'' document can 
     accompany any changes submitted for compliance with descriptions of the 
     changes made for each and every review comment along with changes 
     CLOUDED on drawings.  This document will expedite the review process.
2)  A review of the Site Plan indicated:
         No comments    
3)  A review of the Product Approval Specification Sheet indicated:
         No comments    
4)  A review of the Energy Calculation indicated:
         A)  The orientation of the home identified on the Energy Calculation R405 
               does not correspond to the orientation of the home shown on the Site 
               Plan.  Submit a calculation with the correct orientation.  FBCEC R405  
5) A review of the truss package indicated:
         A)  The plan set specifies a typical truss anchor that cannot be identified.  As 
               a result, the truss package cannot be reviewed.  
6)  A review of the Plan Set indicated:
         A)  The digital seal and signature on the provided plan set could not be 
               verified.  Submit plan set with digitally verifiable seal and signature.  
               FBC 107
         B)  The Table of Content on Sheet CS did not correspond to the provided 
               plan set.  Please clarify.  FBC 107
         C)  The Floor Plan on Sheet X.X specifies several W103 windows.  The 
               Window Schedule on the same sheet does not include this window.  
               Please clarify.  FBC 107
         C)  The Floor Plan on Sheet X.X specifies “agress” windows.  Please clarify.  
                FBC 107
         D)  It is unclear if the gables shown in the Front Elevation on Sheet A1.2 
               have siding or texture cement finish.  Please clarify.  FBC 107
         E)  The Hurricane Clip Schedule on Sheet A1.3 specifies the typical truss 
               anchor to be a Simpson HEAT A16.  The Simpson catalog does not 
               include this anchor.  Please clarify.  FBC 107
         F)  Sheet A1.3 includes a truss layout title with no truss layout.  Please 
               clarify.  FBC 107
         G)  Sheet S1.0 included several section detail titles with no details.  Please 
               clarify.  FBC 107
         H)  The plan set included two lintel plans.  Please clarify.  FBC 107
          I)  The plan set did not include a building wall section showing a continuous 
               load path from the roof assembly to the foundation.  Revise plan to 
               provide this information.  FBC R301
 


