PLANS 3 STRUCTURAL REVIEW PERFORMED BY:  
Jeff Faucett - (352) 438-2416
8/31/2026 -  DENIED as noted


SCOPE:   SFR “Sunny“ MODEL / CMU CONST. / 1 STORY
                4 BEDROOMS - 2 BATHS / COVERED LANAI
                2 CAR GARAGE - RIGHT - FRONT LOADED


REVIEW COMMENTS:
1)	For clarification purposes, a ''Response to Comments'' document can accompany any changes submitted for compliance with descriptions of the changes made for each and every review comment along with changes CLOUDED on drawings.  This document will expedite the review process.
2)	An Energy Calculation with an R405 that shows an orientation that correspond to the Site has not been provided.  FBCEC R405 
NOTE:  This item has not been addressed
It should be noted that the Energy Calculation indicated the main exterior door and the garage door face northeast.  The approved Site Plan shows these doors face west.
3)	The Product Approval Specification Sheet did not include an approval number for the wood siding specified in the Elevations on Sheet A1.2.  Provide an approval number for this product.  F.S. 553.842 and FAC 9N-J 
NOTE:  This item has not been addressed
The response document indicates the product approval number has been added to the Product Approval Specification Sheet, but it has not.
4)	Corrected
5)  The truss layout included in the truss package does not correspond to the truss layout on Sheet A1.3 of the Plan Set.  Please clarify.  FBC 107.2.1


ADVISORY NOTES:
1)  Residential Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing work to be field verified, 
     drawings not reviewed per Marion County policy and FBC 107.3.5
2)  Applicant, Builder and or Contractor shall provide and have available on site at 
     time of inspection, the installation specifications or guidelines for all exterior
     component and cladding elements either listed on a product approval form or
     depicted on the plans.'
